%% Use-case diagram for the system
usecaseDiagram
    actor Student
    actor Teacher
    actor Proctor
    actor Admin

    Student --> (Register / Login)
    Student --> (Take Exam)
    Student --> (View Results)
    Student --> (Perform Technical Check)

    Teacher --> (Create Exam)
    Teacher --> (Create Questions)
    Teacher --> (Review Results)

    Proctor --> (Monitor Session)
